{"lyrics":"[Intro]\n[00:00.72]I don't talk shit (No, no), no\n[00:14.36]Ayy\n[Chorus]\n[00:15.84]We don't talk shit, we let the stick talk shit\n[00:18.68]We don't walk shit, we let the stick walk shit\n[00:22.60]I be getting high on the skywalk shit\n[00:30.76]Then I mix it up with the Moon rock shit\n[00:32.70]Ayy, let my stick talk, bitch\n[00:35.70]Shoot him in his shit and now he Crip walkin'\n[00:39.46]I be getting high on the skywalk shit\n[00:43.24]Then I mix it up with the Moon rock shit\n[Verse 1]\n[00:47.22]And mix it up with a little bit of that and a little bit of this\n[00:52.38]Look, baby, I'm too fucking high to take a pic\n[00:56.56]I understand you wanna vibe a little bit\n[00:59.62]But understand that I'm too high to give a shit\n[01:03.36]She told me I don't tell the truth, I'm full of lies\n[01:05.80]But I know that she too afraid of other guys\n[01:09.52]I told her it's the ugly truth, don't be surprised\n[01:12.14]I told her I would only tell her one time\n[01:15.18]Now shut the fuck up and have a good time\n[01:17.50]When she walks in the room, you see Margiela on her shoes\n[01:23.06]But she's as shallow as a pool, so I don't know what to do at all\n[Chorus]\n[01:26.00]We don't talk shit, we let the stick talk shit\n[01:28.90]We don't walk shit, we let the stick walk shit\n[01:30.60]I be getting high on the skywalk shit\n[01:32.02]Then I mix it up with the Moon rock shit\n[01:33.46]Ayy, let my stick talk, bitch\n[01:34.86]Shoot him in his shit and now he Crip walkin'\n[01:37.14]I be getting high on the skywalk shit\n[01:38.56]Then I mix it up with the Moon rock shit\n[Verse 2]\n[01:40.36]When I walk in the room, I'll be walking to my doom\n[01:43.40]So I'll have my hand on a tool\n[01:46.24]I know they want me to lose, and fall\n[01:47.96]Bitches come in twos, so I'll admit I fucked a few\n[01:50.32]But just a few will never do\n[01:52.42]If I fuck one I guess, I gotta smash em' all\n[01:56.00]But don't get it confused, I'm nothing like thes